---
title: AdviseCare - Sequence Diagram SD-06 - Deactivate or Ban Account
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor ADM as System Administrator
    participant W as Web App
    participant C as AccountsController
    participant S as AccountService
    participant R as IGenericRepository
    participant DB as SQL Server
    ADM->>W: Open account and click "Deactivate" (or "Ban")
    W->>C: PUT /api/Accounts/{id}/deactivate
    C->>S: DeactivateAsync(ActorId, AccountId)
    alt actor is the account itself
        S-->>C: ValidationException
        C-->>W: 400 Bad Request
    else other account
        S->>R: GetByIdAsync(account)
        S->>R: PrepareUpdate status = deactivated (or banned)
        S->>R: Stage ending every active session of the account
        S->>R: SaveAsync()
        R->>DB: UPDATE ACCOUNTS, SESSIONS
        S->>S: Log activity accountDeactivated
        S-->>C: true
        C-->>W: 200 OK
    end
